* Independent current source, AC (2.47.0): a 1 A small-signal current into a parallel RC.
* Expected: V(out) = R/(1 + jwRC), the network's impedance: 1000 Ohm (60 dB) below the
*   corner at f = 1/(2*pi*RC) = 159.15 Hz, falling at -20 dB/decade with phase toward -90 deg.
I1 gnd out  DC 0 AC 1
